Package: oocp
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: COPY ENGINE
 Zero-copy clone-capable file and directory copier using io_uring and copy_file_range.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 recursive directory replication, reflink clone, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
